{"id":"657563","name":"卤肥肠","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/657563/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肥肠","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"1块"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"4-5颗"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"4-5颗"},{"name":"大料","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"1块"},{"name":"草果","amount":"1个"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"4-5片"},{"name":"豆瓣酱","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"热油倒入黄冰糖。","img":"images/657563/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"炒到变成红褐色，加热水。","img":"images/657563/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备个糖色。","img":"images/657563/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洗好的肥肠焯水，放入葱姜去腥。","img":"images/657563/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"撇去浮沫，焯水焯透。","img":"images/657563/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备卤料，所见即所得，没有科技与狠活。","img":"images/657563/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"热油炒香配料。","img":"images/657563/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加一勺豆瓣酱炒出红油。","img":"images/657563/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加热水大火煮开。","img":"images/657563/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放去胡椒粉和盐调味。","img":"images/657563/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入肥肠煮一个小时。","img":"images/657563/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"捞出香料，肥肠继续在汤里泡着。","img":"images/657563/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"三分卤，七分泡。","img":"images/657563/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"泡一宿，捞出来，就可以吃啦。","img":"images/657563/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}